><summary type="html">The vote is being seen as a test of popularity for Prime Minister Andrej Babis's government.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Africa pulls asylum directive after violent protests in Johannesburg, Durban</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7da6e7c1a02cc028754003a0edd2d816dba893fdf224a9a5671b7dd85f150437</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:03:14Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T09:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-africa-pulls-asylum-directive-after-violent-protests-in-johannesburg-durban/a-79605037--3528cacc90b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-africa-pulls-asylum-directive-after-violent-protests-in-johannesburg-durban/a-79605037?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">South Africa has withdrawn a controversial asylum directive after anti-migrant protests descended into violence and chaos on Thursday.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany women's football team: Can Ena Mahmutovic make a case to become Germany's next No.1 goalkeeper?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:28923f0ebe181b5b98e2a8cabef1582cc6e51cd3bcf5cce19d0aa0dff14be2a8</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T09:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-women-s-football-team-can-ena-mahmutovic-make-a-case-to-become-germany-s-next-no-1-goalkeepe/a-79609341--5da82027e599.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-women-s-football-team-can-ena-mahmutovic-make-a-case-to-become-germany-s-next-no-1-goalkeeper/a-79609341?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The women's friendlies against Australia and Japan present an opportunity for Ena Mahmutovic to make her case for succeeding Ann-Katrin Berger as Germany's first-choice goalkeeper.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Bosnia and Herzegovina will soon have a new Grand Mufti</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b19da347c50c77327e3a71ff239e8ee07256f82b02d259d5fba40ffc96f2e55a</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T08:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-will-soon-have-a-new-grand-mufti/a-79604402--960d4eb80e56.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-will-soon-have-a-new-grand-mufti/a-79604402?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new leader of the Islamic Community in Bosnia and Herzegovina will be elected on October 10. The reis-ul-ulema's role is not only important for Muslims in the country itself, but could inspire Muslims across Europe.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Finland, the world's happiest nation, faces a glum winter</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f00f4b3e0736fa49f7d026af2dffc96bd885a1f98080635a7d1eacc3264c39df</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/finland-the-world-s-happiest-nation-faces-a-glum-winter/a-79544348--0df829428818.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/finland-the-world-s-happiest-nation-faces-a-glum-winter/a-79544348?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finns have many reasons to feel content, but the country's pile of debt is not one of them. Russia's war in Ukraine has added to the fiscal burden. Can the Nordic nation absorb another shock?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU pulls sponsorship from Disinfo2026 event in Lithuania</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3eb8c58b9d9503056cc33a87ae87e453451efc5e0b8c9b90a9a79f28167bd276</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T16:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-pulls-sponsorship-from-disinfo2026-event-in-lithuania/a-79599615--b060dac4b016.html" type="text/ht