maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia-Herzegovina's three-member presidency is set to be dominated by nationalists from the three major ethnic groups, including Zeljka ​Cvijanovic, backed by disqualified Serb secessionist leader Milorad Dodik.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK remands 2 Iranians over alleged antisemitic terror plot</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:17b9886cda6b72becd7924e7a9de2645ee3f7847246c9ac0c5e155f04c71a83e</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T16:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184--b38b3689556f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The pair were arrested on the eve of Yom Kippur and later charged with plotting to attack Jewish targets in Manchester.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bosnia and Herzegovina is still shaped by war, separatism, EU ambitions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0ec0cdce27cfbc6441dc03778cd575ecda077fb67ae1ba4ffed264d97273e2a5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T06:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-is-still-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557--c6b59bb6d492.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-is-still-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia and Herzegovina is governed by a system established after the Bosnian war — more than 30 years ago. Ethnic divisions, a complex administration and European integration all shape the country's political reality.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>German reunification: How inequality is s